WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
As time passes, Korede finds herself caught in an increasingly complicated situation.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Her feelings for Tade remain unspoken, while Ayoola continues to attract the attention of those around her.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
For Korede, watching this unfold becomes harder than she expected.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
At the hospital, Korede has always been someone people can depend on.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.500
She is responsible, observant and careful.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.000
But behind that composed personality lies a person struggling with emotions she cannot openly express.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Tade represents something different in her life — a possibility of happiness beyond her responsibilities.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Ayoola and Korede share a bond that is difficult to explain.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
They are sisters, but their relationship is far from simple.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Korede constantly finds herself protecting Ayoola, even when she questions the choices her sister makes.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.500
And slowly, the weight of keeping everything together begins to affect her.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.000
The situation becomes more complicated as Tade grows closer to Ayoola.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Korede must confront a painful reality: the person she cares about may never see her the way she hopes.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.000
But her biggest struggle is not simply about love.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.500
It is about loyalty, responsibility and how long someone can keep protecting another person without losing themselves.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.000
And as the story moves forward, one question becomes impossible to ignore:

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.000
How much can Korede sacrifice for her sister?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:25.000
The answer may change everything.
